SUMMARY:The Magic Banana Hour
DESCRIPTION:The sold-out hit returns to the Sebastiani Theatre with an all new line up of comedy\, circus & chaos! \nThe Magic Banana Hour is an hour-ish of world class comedy\, music\, magic & mayhem!\nInspired by vintage variety shows and flipped completely on its head\, it’s an unforgettable experience featuring performers from Cirque Du Soleil & Blue Man Group.\nLast year we sold out! This year expect the same big laughs\, unexpected beauty\, & joyful chaos in a show where anything can happen!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-magic-banana-hour/
