SUMMARY:Soul Fuse at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Soul Fuse brings powerhouse horns\, deep grooves\, and world-class talent for an electrifying night of funk and soul.\nSoul Fuse is a nine-piece Soul\, Funk\, and R&B band delivering a dynamic blend of original music and classic grooves. Featuring musicians who have performed with legends like Loggins and Messina\, The Eagles\, and Gregg Allman\, the band brings exceptional musicianship and undeniable chemistry to every performance.\nFor over a decade\, Soul Fuse has energized audiences across Sonoma County and Northern California. Anchored by their signature Fuser Horns\, their sound is bold\, tight\, and irresistibly danceable—combining precision arrangements with deep rhythm and soul that keeps crowds on their feet. \nDoors Open: 6:30 PM | Show Starts: 7:30 PM\nTickets $15 in advance. $22 at door
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/soul-fuse-at-the-california-theatre/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Soul-Fuse.jpg
