SUMMARY:Matsuri! Japanese Arts Festival
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a vibrant celebration of Japanese arts and culture at Juilliard Park in Santa Rosa. \nExperience live demonstrations of taiko drumming\, folk dance and music\, martial arts\, and traditional mochi pounding throughout the day. \nThis year’s special feature is Sumo demonstration by Honu Sumo from San Diego. \nExplore cultural exhibits\, art\, clothing\, authentic cuisine\, a Japanese language booth\, origami\, and hands-on activities for kids. \nFree admission and fun for all ages!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/matsuri-japanese-arts-festival/
