SUMMARY:2nd Annual Bloom Hip Hop Festival & Car Show
DESCRIPTION:Bloom 2nd Annual Hip Hop Festival and car show is a dynamic celebration of hip hop culture\, featuring an exciting mix of breakdance\, popping and all youth dance battles\, a Lowrider vs Hot Rod Car Show\, live emcee cyphers\, vibrant graffiti murals and more.\nThis unique event brings together artists\, dancers\, hip hop enthusiasts to create a day full of energy and creativity. Attendees will witness incredible talent in a high-energy atmosphere while supporting a great cause: proceeds from the festival benefit the Sebastopol Community Cultural Center’s youth programming.\nBloom Hip Hop Festival serves as a platform for self-expression and community empowerment\, offering young people in the area the opportunity to engage in the arts and inspire future generations of artists.\nFunds generated from this event will go toward keeping the Youth Programs & Sebastopol Community Cultural Center alive & running.\nPARKING IS LIMITED IN AREA! PLEASE CARPOOL!!!! \n💧 We are striving for a zero waste event. Please bring your own reusable waterbottle!\nRegistration links are below for car show\, dance battle\, emcee cypher and/or to be a vendor.\n– Car show is limited to 40 vehicles and is first come first serve! (edit: 20 spaces left)\n– Vending is limited to 20 spaces…\n– Only 10 emcees will be approved for emcee cypher\nRegistration etc coming soon!\nemail: Sean at youthprograms@seb.org with any questions \nBLOOM Event Schedule for the day! (Subject to change)\n— OUTDOOR SCHEDULE —\nTBA\n— INDOOR —\n11AM – 2PM\nWorkshops\n1PM\nMain Hall doors open!\nBreaking\, Popping\, All Styles Warm Up\n2PM\nBreaking/Popping Battle Prelims\n2:45PM\nDJ Scratch Showcase\n3PM\n18 & under All Styles “7 to Smoke”\n3:15PM\nBeatbox Showcase\n3:30PM\nEmcee Cypher\n4:20PM\nTop 8 Breaking/Popping Battles\n5PM\nBreaking/Popping Finals\n5:20PM\nEmcee Final Battle\n5:30PM\nAward Ceremony\n— 6PM Event Ends \nAll Ages \nTICKETS: \nKids 12 & under FREE!\nAges 18+ $10 advance ($15 at the door) \nFEATURING:\nLive DJs\nBreaking Battle\nEmcee Cypher\nLive Graff Mural\nDJ Scratch Showcase\nMusic\, Art\, & Dance Workshops\nBeatbox Showcase\nLowrider & Hot Rod Car Show\nArts & Crafts Vendors\nLocal Eats & more!!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/2nd-annual-bloom-hip-hop-festival-car-show/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center\, 390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA
