SUMMARY:The Musers (Matinée)
DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission\nDoors at 4:00pm.\nShow from 4:45-7:00pm with one intermission \nEarlybirds!\n$3 off each ticket when you use the code earlybird16 at checkout. Offer ends May 10th.\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\nCodes are not case sensitive\, but must be typed as one word. \nThe Musers are like a goofy gang of musical siblings. They offer a refreshing and varied take on classic acoustic Americana\, delivering three-part harmonies and dancey grooves with verve and heart. The Musers are award-winning singer-songwriters Megan McLaughlin and Anita Bear Sandwina\, with stand-up bassist Tom Kuhn. They’ve been charming audiences since 2017.\nhttps://www.themusersband.com/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/themusersband/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/themusersband\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@TheMusersBand \nRecommended If You Like: Rainbow Girls\, Shawn Colvin\, I’m With Her
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-musers-matinee/
