SUMMARY:Voices in my Head at Murphy's
DESCRIPTION:Glory Dayz celebrates the best of the best classic rock-n-roll music from the 50’s through the 80’s. With front man Frankie Adel – former lead singer from Sha Na Na – bringing his dynamic stage presence\, this band will keep you dancing all night long. Our collective experience includes working with some of music’s greats such as: Celine Dion\, Hall & Oates\, Huey Lewis\, Beach Boys\, Paul Anka\, Kenny Rogers and more. Our goal is to ignite music memories from your own Glory Days. We fill the house with good vibes\, good crowds and rockin-good times!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/voices-in-my-head-at-murphys-4/
